# Bodies — 72 bpm, E minor. A demo of bodies: tracks heard inside
# modelled objects and rooms, and morphs from one body into another.
#
#   beats  0-8    GLASS   a mallet figure inside a wine glass, its ring
#                         modes answering every note
#   beats  8-16   BOX     the glass becomes a steel box, while a pluck
#                         knocks inside a wooden crate
#   beats 16-32   NAVE    a pad opens from a small room into a cathedral,
#                         and the whole mix moves into a hall

bpm 72
gate 0.9
tail 6

section GLASS 0..8
section BOX 8..16
section NAVE 16..32

automate reverb_wet
0

body hall
automate body_mix
0 >16 0 0.3:8@smooth

track tap patch=mallet vel=0.8 body=glass..metal body_mix=0.75
(E5:0.5 G5:0.5 B5:0.5 G5:0.5)x4 (E5:0.5 G5:0.5 B5:0.5 D6:0.5)x4 R:16
automate tap.body_morph
0 >8 0 1:4@smooth

track knock patch=nc-pluck vel=0.7 body=wood
R:8 (E3 . B2 . E3 B2 . .)x1 R:16

track pad patch=softpad vel=0.6 body=room..cathedral
R:16 [E3 B3 G4]:8 [C3 G3 E4]:6 R:2
automate pad.body_morph
0 >16 0 1:12@smooth
